ete to be the first across the finish line!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807480/extras/709a40fa7fa7881186a7d044ab8e78eb.poster.avif?t=1695857466\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807480/extras/709a40fa7fa7881186a7d044ab8e78eb.webm?t=1695857466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807480/extras/709a40fa7fa7881186a7d044ab8e78eb.mp4?t=1695857466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Vertical Shift also features a single-player campaign! Explore the City of Orion, a futuristic metropolis on the brink of collapse. Join the resistance and help take down the evil government through a variety of missions and activities. Or just swing around and take in the sights!<br><br><br>See you in the Arenas!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807480/extras/c0f63aab7c3febc264c261c97d4b5d30.avif?t=1695857466\" /></div>",
